  "description": "MAQGEU crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C64 H58 Dy4 N12 O13 S4,4(C1 H4 O1),H2 O1. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.447-3.618 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 90.36-112.01°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C68H76Dy4N12O18S4. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ4-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
